In this video,

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.250
In this video,

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.250
the three members of Colors (Yui, Sat-chan, Kotoha)

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:14.370
In this video,

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:14.370
the three members of Colors (Yui, Sat-chan, Kotoha)

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:14.370
will introduce the town and the people

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:14.370
they constantly work to protect.

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.750
Is it really recording?

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.290
Yes, it is.

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:20.330
There wasn't any sound.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.290
You just couldn't hear it.

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:25.950
You should just go over there and check. Just once.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:27.450
There wasn't any sound.

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:29.950
Ugh, fine.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.000
Is it recording?

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.830
There wasn't any sound.

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:36.160
See? I told you it's recording!

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:40.580
Um, this is Whale Factory.

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:44.910
I mean, here I am at Whale Factory.

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:48.750
Hello! I'm Yui, leader of Colors.

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:52.790
Now let's talk to Whale Factory.

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:55.120
I will interview an employee!

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.080
I'm sorry!

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:01.750
This is the salesman, Kujiraoka-san!

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:03.500
I'm Kujiraoka.

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:06.870
Wait, your name is Kujiraoka?

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:09.290
Note: Roughly means "my large son of the whale hill".

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:09.330
Yup, Daigoro Kujiraoka.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.950
Even your name is huge!

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:13.950
So... what are you filming?

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:16.330
An introduction to your shop.

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:19.870
We're making a video guide to Colors and our town.

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:23.200
Wow, that's really something.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:27.450
We're going to record it,

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:27.450
then you'll edit it, and we'll upload it.

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:29.830
What? That's the first I've heard of this.

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.200
But, well, okay.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.410
My arm is tired.

00:01:35.410 --> 00:01:38.500
Pops, my arm is tired. Can we be done?

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:41.950
And there you have it. That was Whale Factory!

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:43.950
Did you get my good side?

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:47.910
Next, we have my family's Kise Fruits!

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:49.330
This is my mom!

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:51.830
Welcome to Kise Fruits!

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:55.500
My mom is very pretty, but she's constipated!

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:56.540
Cut!

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:58.160
That did not happen! Take it out!

00:01:58.160 --> 00:01:59.790
Koto-chan, start over!

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:01.910
W-we'll bleep it out!

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:04.120
Consti-BLEEP!

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:05.620
How is that any better?!

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:09.370
Sat-chan, you're asking for

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:09.370
a taste of the banana nightmare diet!

00:02:09.870 --> 00:02:12.790
Okay, um, this is Kise Fruits!

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:14.500
She started over.

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:17.080
Welcome to Kise Fruits!

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:18.950
This is my beautiful mom!

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:23.250
Oh, Sat-chan, you tease.

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:23.250
What an adorable child you are!

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:25.750
Because I have such a beautiful mom!

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:32.370
Koto-chan! Get a closeup of Mom's face!

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:32.370
She's real pretty up close, too!

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:37.790
Oh, stop it! Then I'll be in the video

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:37.790
with my adorable little girl!

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:40.160
Maybe people will come here just to see you!

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.830
And you!

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:47.450
If you want to see my beautiful mom

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:47.450
and adorable Sat-chan, come to Kise Fruits!

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:51.410
Oh dear, oh dear! Business is going to be booming!

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:57.330
What's something you do on a boat?

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:59.250
Uh, is this a riddle?

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:01.500
Um, row?

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:04.410
Yeah, you row the boat, and then what?

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:11.080
Look at the scenery?

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:12.830
Yes! You look around!

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:15.750
And what mode are you in when you do that?

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.120
Mode?

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:19.000
What are they talking about?

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.540
You're stopped, right?

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:20.700
Boats

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:24.040
Yes! You're stopped!

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:27.540
And when you're just stopped, what are you doing?

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:28.750
On a boat.

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:30.290
On a boat.

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:32.330
Hanging aboat!

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:36.620
'Kay, bye!

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:38.410
You're not gonna rent one?

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:40.500
What's so funny?

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:44.330
Hello, Nonoka Sasaki here.

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:48.200
I'm here at a certain very popular bakery.

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.660
And here it is!

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:52.080
Sasaki Bread!

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:56.830
It's a locally based shop where they treat you like family.

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:01.000
Now let's get right to it

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:01.000
and talk to one of their employees!

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:04.500
Has this bakery been around a long time?

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:07.830
Well, next year it's going to be an onigiri shop.

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:08.870
It is not.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:11.950
These children seem to really be enjoying their bread.

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:13.450
Do you like it?

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:16.620
Yes, it's very yummy.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.120
We were bribed with juice to-

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:21.250
I see! So, you really like it, huh?

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:26.660
When you stop in, tell them you've seen this video.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:31.830
There might just be a campaign where viewers

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:31.830
can receive a free sample of a new product!

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.910
What? The poor things!

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:36.120
Let's give them onigiri.

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:37.830
And this girl works here!

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:39.950
Have you all turned against me?!

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:43.700
This is Sasaki Bread!

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.040
Come on by!

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:49.000
That's Saito.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:53.160
The town is peaceful thanks to us,

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:53.160
so he's always just slacking off.

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:55.500
So occasionally we give him something to do.

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.500
Stupid dummyhead!

00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:00.250
Ten times out of ten, you are the dummyhead.

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:02.700
The one who calls people dummyhead is a dummyhead!

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:05.450
Then you're still the dummyhead!

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:06.790
Oh! She took it.

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.290
Hey! Don't steal a policeman's bicycle!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:14.370
You got a case?

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:15.870
Oh! She took it.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.660
What? You lost something?

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:19.660
Don't answer the phone, stupid!

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:21.080
You'll never see it again.

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:23.000
Don't ever try this at home!!

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:23.000
Don't hang up-

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:25.660
Okay, for real this time!

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:29.120
That was our town.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:32.450
And this town is protected by - you guessed it!

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:33.950
One, two...

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:35.080
A pigeon!

