00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:09.200
Mitsuboshi Jump!

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:18.450
Hello? This is Red. Do you copy? Come in!

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:21.200
This is Yellow! Is it a case?

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:24.080
Aww, I don't hear anything.

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:27.540
My walkie-talkie's battery is dead.

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:29.870
Hello? Hello! Come in!

00:07:29.870 --> 00:07:31.290
Is it a case?!

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:33.620
Come in! Is it a case?!

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:35.830
Is-it-a-case?!

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:37.500
It's not a case.

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:39.290
You heard me.

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:41.160
You're right in front of me.

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:42.580
It's a case, isn't it!

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:44.450
It is not a case.

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:47.410
Let's get Pops to change the batteries.

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:48.870
Abra-Onigiri!

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:51.370
Abra-Onigiri?

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:53.450
Abra-Onigiri!

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:56.370
It's Koto-chan's voice!

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.290
Abra-Onigiri!

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:01.620
Kotoha, what's going on?

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:07.290
How many times are you going to

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:07.290
make me say "abra-onigiri"?

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:09.580
What is "abra-onigiri"?

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:12.120
Did you forget the password?

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:14.040
Password?

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:18.000
I thought we decided that we'd have to say the password

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:18.000
when coming in to the hideout.

00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:20.660
Oh yeah, I forgot.

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:23.080
What was the password again?

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:24.080
Is this a case?

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:25.540
It's not a case.

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:30.250
Remember? When someone says, "How do we get

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:30.250
there?" you answer, "With flying Colors."

00:08:30.450 --> 00:08:32.790
Oh, that's it! I remember now.

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:34.700
How do we get there?

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.040
With flying Colors.

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:37.370
That's right!

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.200
So, what's Abra-Onigiri?

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:41.580
Is it a case?!

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:43.370
It's not a case!

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.660
I have a case.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:48.200
You do? A case!

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:52.250
On my way to the hideout,

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:52.250
I ran into Granny Koro, from the korokke shop.

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:54.830
She said she wants us to stop by later...

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:57.040
...for a big case.

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:58.200
A big case?

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:00.870
Do you think it's like a Level 2?

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:02.580
Let's go right now!

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:05.790
Okay! We're gonna solve Granny Koro's case!

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:07.250
Yeah!

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:12.620
Granny Koro! We're on our way!

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:16.370
Do you think she'll give us korokke

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:16.370
after we solve her case?

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:18.620
I want a beef korokke!

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:20.750
Corn is the best!

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:24.160
We'll solve the case after we negotiate our fee.

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:25.830
Oh, good idea!

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:28.870
It's a whirly-twirly power spot!

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:31.080
Let's give it a whirly-twirly charge while we're here!

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:32.660
Whirly-twirly charge!

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:39.000
The whirly-twirly power spot

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:39.000
is getting a whirly-twirly charge!

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:46.580
Ugh, you whirled too much.

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:49.870
You know you can't handle spinny things, Sat-chan.

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:51.910
You charged it too much.

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:55.000
Wow, Kotoha! That's really fast!

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:00.450
You charged it too much!

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:03.250
I can keep whirling forever.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.580
Whoever made that is a worthless human being.

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:12.830
They'll die after a life of mediocrity.

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:16.250
Now this is not worthless!

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:17.750
Wait for me!

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:27.540
Let's have a race to see

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:27.540
who can get from here to there fastest!

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:28.870
Yeah!

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:30.540
Alright, Yui, count!

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:31.500
Okay!

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:35.120
One! Two! Three!

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:36.660
Hey, that's not fair!

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:38.120
Yes, it is. I warped.

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:39.410
Warping's not fair!

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:43.000
Eight! Nine! Ten!

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:44.500
This is where it gets hard!

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:45.580
Jeez.

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:49.040
Wanna play with us, Kotoha?

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.370
I'm taking a break.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.700
Then hold this for me.

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:53.580
Sure.

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:55.830
Less than ten seconds!

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:57.330
You're lying!

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:58.950
I am not!

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:00.790
Okay, then do it again!

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:01.750
You got it!

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:06.250
Forty-one! Forty-two! Forty-three!

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.700
Sat-chan, you're good.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.540
You need more training!

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:27.540
Kotoha, let's go!

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:29.080
Okay.

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.250
Thank you.

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:34.160
What should we do?

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:36.450
Weren't we on the way to something?

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:37.950
What was it again?

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:39.700
What was it?

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:41.910
Oh! I remember!

00:11:42.040 --> 00:11:44.790
I was gonna get Pops to change the batteries!

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:46.000
That's it!

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:48.000
Off to Pops's shop!

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:49.370
Yeah!

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:52.000
Spring is here!

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:03.910
It's spring!

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.040
PANDA

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.040
CAKES

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.120
Picnic season!

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:08.750
Mini cake season!

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:11.700
I want some mini cakes!

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:12.870
Me, too!

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:15.410
I know! I have a great idea!

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:17.250
Kise Fruits

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:20.290
You want to sell strawberries to all the picnickers?

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:21.500
Yeah!

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:23.580
We'll sell them to the drunks!

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:25.200
They're stupid, so they'll buy.

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:27.450
They're not stupid! I think.

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:31.080
It does seem like a good sales plan.

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:35.040
Well, it would be a big help for me, but...

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:39.040
I expect you're going to want something in return for this?

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:40.000
Uh-huh!

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:43.000
Can we use our profits to buy mini cakes?

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:44.700
Mini cakes?

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:46.750
The ones the street vendors sell?

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:47.450
Yeah!

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:49.830
Well, that should be fine.

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:50.950
Really?

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:56.870
Thanks, Mom!

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:58.450
Okay, see you later!

00:12:58.450 --> 00:12:59.580
Okay!

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:03.040
They're so cute.

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:05.910
Just you wait, drunkards!

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:08.580
We're gonna bleed you dry!

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:12.450
Ueno Onshi Park

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:16.790
There's people everywhere!

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:18.120
Perfect time for profits.

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:19.450
Perfect for profits!

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:21.450
I want mini cakes!

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:22.410
Here we go!

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:23.950
Mini cakes!

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:26.370
In matters like this,

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:26.370
the first move will make or break you.

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:29.290
You find a mark and reel him in.

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:31.290
Oh! I've heard that before!

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:33.950
Okay, we'll start with them!

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:37.250
Hello?

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:39.580
People line up for these strawberries.

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:41.080
What? Line up?

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:43.830
She's already making up random stuff!

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:45.160
Indeed.

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:47.450
Are they featured in magazines and stuff, then?

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:52.330
No, we value our regular patrons,

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:52.330
so we refuse all interview requests.

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:54.500
That's what all the store people say!

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:55.330
Indeed.

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:58.950
Then maybe I'll buy some! One pack!

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:00.200
Thanks for doing business!

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:01.910
She sold some!

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:05.950
I feel like, now, I could even sell diamonds!

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:07.450
That is good.

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:09.120
You're amazing, Sat-chan!

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:12.500
Okay! Time for Operation: Strawberry Salesgirls!

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:14.160
Yeah!

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:17.370
I have some line-forming strawberries!

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:19.450
Oh, it's the girl from the other day.

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:22.040
Maybe we'll take a pack.

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:25.500
Would you like some strawberries?

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:26.950
Oh! Those look good!

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:28.790
Not bananas today?

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:31.290
Maybe we'll take some back to the shop later.

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:34.750
It's the zombie girl.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.290
You're killing me!

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:38.410
Want some of this, too?

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:39.750
Yes.

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:45.950
Well, well. You're selling strawberries today?

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:48.000
Want to take some sweets with you?

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:50.790
Not today! We're gonna have mini cakes!

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.500
What's that about?

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:54.660
Those are some weird glasses!

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:57.290
Panda Beer

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:57.290
Panda Beer

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.660
They say strawberries help baldness.

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:01.120
Oh?

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:04.080
Maybe I'll take two packs.

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:08.040
Line-forming poop!

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:11.200
Oops, I mean line-forming strawberries!

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:11.200
Anybody want some?

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:15.200
Now see here, you can't go around

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:15.200
saying "poop" everywhere.

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:18.830
Yui-chan! What are you doing?

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:20.500
I'm selling strawberries.

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:23.250
You're helping? Wow!

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.200
See you later!

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:26.410
Bye-bye!

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:30.080
What? Line-forming strawberries?

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:32.580
You girls are such hard workers.

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:34.950
Wow, a part-time job, huh?

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:36.580
It's not a job!

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:40.660
I like coffee, but I like strawberries, too.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.160
I'd like some strawberries!

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:48.120
Strawberries!

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:49.830
Wait for me!

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:56.080
That's weird.

00:15:56.830 --> 00:15:58.830
We can't sell the last one!

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.790
Why not?

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:02.790
Is it because it looks like leftovers?

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:05.790
I think we can sell it when people get more drunk.

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:07.120
The diamond.

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:09.410
Let's not sell a diamond.

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:12.040
We need a new strategy.

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:19.790
That's it!

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:30.370
Hello there!

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:33.250
We're Colors.

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:35.700
Let's just all calm down.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:36.870
What?

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:40.080
Sometimes, things just don't go your way.

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.410
Like with work.

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:43.370
Yes, like with work.

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:44.370
Mm-hm!

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.700
H-how did you know that?

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:49.950
You're right.

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:54.330
But it's not really work. I'm looking for work,

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:54.330
and even that's not going my way.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:58.870
I applied to so many companies.

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:03.000
We weren't talking about you. We were talking about us.

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:03.950
Huh?

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:07.660
Yeah. Anyway, eat this!

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:07.660
Do it now and it comes with a special bonus!

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:08.950
Uh, no.

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:10.660
Wait a minute.

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:13.660
If you don't eat it, we can't start the bonus.

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:15.450
What do you mean, "bonus"?

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:17.120
Eat it now.

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:20.870
Did you eat it?

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:22.410
Uh, yes.

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:27.120
Okay!

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.540
Open up!

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:34.160
Spring is here!

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:41.870
Tada!

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:47.330
Thanks.

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:49.580
That made me feel better.

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:55.330
I only have 500 yen in my wallet,

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:55.330
but now I feel like I can go for another interview.

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:58.250
What? Only 500 yen?

00:17:58.250 --> 00:17:59.620
But you're a grownup.

00:17:59.790 --> 00:18:01.660
That was a close one.

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:03.700
But it's just barely enough.

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:07.160
Thank you, sir!

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:09.660
That will be 500 yen for the strawberries!

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:12.660
Thanks for doing business!

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:15.750
Huh?

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:19.370
What?

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:24.160
Well, whatever.

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:27.040
Easy to Digest

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:35.700
Mini cakes are the best!

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:36.700
Delicious.

00:18:36.700 --> 00:18:37.790
Yummy!

