00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:37.790
What? Ugh, Sat-chan, that's gross!

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:40.200
Oh, Saito-san. Hello.

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:41.160
Hi.

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:43.450
