00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:37.330
Yeah!

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:42.620
But today we have this futon, so let's get ready.

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:53.160
Paralleloman

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:55.700
