00:22:22.830 --> 00:22:23.910
It does not.

00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:26.330
I'm tired.

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:28.830
So tired.

00:22:29.450 --> 00:22:30.950
Very tired.

00:22:39.410 --> 00:22:40.700
What a peaceful day.

00:23:06.040 --> 00:23:36.000
Colors

00:23:06.200 --> 00:23:08.330
Time for the Colors Evaluation Meeting!

00:23:08.330 --> 00:23:10.120
Oh? We're doing one today?

00:23:10.120 --> 00:23:12.790
But we said we weren't gonna do it

00:23:10.120 --> 00:23:12.790
because it's the last episode.

00:23:12.790 --> 00:23:14.200
I'm taking it back.

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:16.790
Because this is not a preview for the next episode.

00:23:17.790 --> 00:23:21.200
Besides, there's never a last episode to Colors' heroics!

00:23:21.200 --> 00:23:25.120
Colors will go on, as long as we're here

00:23:21.200 --> 00:23:25.120
to protect this town!

00:23:25.120 --> 00:23:28.450
Yeah! Let's go on to solve lots more cases!

00:23:28.450 --> 00:23:30.580
We have to play with Pops, too!

00:23:30.580 --> 00:23:32.830
And I haven't said "I've beat this game" enough.

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:33.830
Okay, everyone!

00:23:33.830 --> 00:23:35.370
Later, Colors!

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:40.950
